Route R (tools/pressure/route.sh): A1 on master, B1 on the epic; master into the epic; a god bead forked from the epic; A2 on master; master into the epic again; then the epic into the god bead. B1's stati moves 251 -> 252 -> 253. Finding: the first merge bead is refused by check_landed_files (STEP 4c) because master's landed resource is new relative to the epic's ledger and sits in a landed file the merge bead does not own; G32-num keeps the numeric content so the route completes.
